    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# ASTROHEALTH\n### 05 | Smart Triage & Escalation Watcher\n**Purpose:** creates evidence-grounded AI briefs and advances durable escalation timers.\n\n**Reliability:** the backend owns jobs, due times, idempotency and ACK cancellation. n8n is safe to restart.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 820
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "d4d6b861-714f-4f75-a911-303f4931ce5c",
      "name": "Workflow Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01. AI Triage\nPoll pending jobs → retrieve only the incident context → Gemini structured JSON → backend validates evidence references before saving.\n\nIf Gemini returns an invalid response or fails, this workflow saves a deterministic fallback brief.",
        "height": 450,
        "width": 1192,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        432,
        224
      ],
      "id": "585a9326-3df8-4c26-8913-ca89982553f5",
      "name": "AI Triage Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02. Escalation\nPoll due rows → advance the durable backend escalation once with a deterministic request_id.\n\nThe backend cancels the active escalation when a doctor ACKs the incident. Add a dedicated doctor-notification channel only after its backend or UI contract is confirmed.",
        "height": 306,
        "width": 1050,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        464,
        768
      ],
      "id": "6c1109f6-2a4c-402a-ab67-05817092630e",
      "name": "Escalation Note"
    }
  ],
